1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
But what's the enemy of self-purification?

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,880
Justification is the enemy of change

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,800
Justification is the enemy of change Yes

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,440
So, one shouldn't justify? No

5
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,000
When to justify? No

6
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,880
I never justify? Don't justify

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:18,320
What I know, Abu-Badr...

8
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,320
That when you take a decision

9
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,600
Don't justify it too much, just be confident about it

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,120
And don't attempt to explain it to everyone

11
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,920
And don't explain your reasons for it

12
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,880
But if someone tells you that you're fast-tempered

13
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,040
You are quick to anger

14
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,280
You'll justify that it is because you anger me

15
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,920
Then, you won't change

16
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,600
Justifying is a preservative, keeps the behavior but doesn't make it taste better

17
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:46,520
It's a preservative, like with sauce, it'll stay sauce after 5 years

18
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,320
So, justification won't change the person

19
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:54,080
That's why, admitting the mistake is the nature of the nobles

20
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,480
It isn't easy

21
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,400
A person who admits his mistake

22
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,800
He has crossed half of the road
